                "Categories": {
                  "value": "Alciato's Book of Emblems|Scans from the Internet Archive/unverified|PD US expired|Scans from the Internet Archive|Books uploaded by Fæ|Books without Wikidata item|IA books of at least 500 pages|Images from the Getty Research Institute|Latin-language books",
